{"title": "Dread Ambusher (Condition)", "pageid": 27710, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Dread_Ambusher_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has tick type", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Dread_Ambusher_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Dread_Ambusher_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Dread_Ambusher_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Dread_Ambusher_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Dread_Ambusher_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Dread_Ambusher_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dread Ambusher Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Dread_Ambusher_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Dread_Ambusher_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/36/Dread_Ambusher_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Dread Ambusher</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Movement_speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement speed\">Movement speed</a> increased by 3 m (10 ft). Affected entity can also make an extra weapon attack that deals an additional 1d8 damage. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">DREAD_AMBUSHER</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CDREAD_AMBUSHER%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CDREAD_AMBUSHER%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Loses duration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\">Loses duration</a>: end of turn</div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\">Grants:</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dread_Ambusher_(Melee)\" title=\"Dread Ambusher (Melee)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Dread_Ambusher_Melee_Icon.webp/40px-Dread_Ambusher_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Dread_Ambusher_Melee_Icon.webp/60px-Dread_Ambusher_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Dread_Ambusher_Melee_Icon.webp/80px-Dread_Ambusher_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dread Ambusher (Melee)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Dread_Ambusher_Melee_Icon.webp/40px-Dread_Ambusher_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Dread_Ambusher_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dread_Ambusher_(Melee)\" title=\"Dread Ambusher (Melee)\">Dread Ambusher (Melee)</a> </dt>\n<dd>On the first turn of each combat, ambush a target with an additional swift and precise attack. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per combat\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per combat.)</dd>\n</dl><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dread_Ambusher_(Ranged)\" title=\"Dread Ambusher (Ranged)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Dread_Ambusher_Ranged_Icon.webp/40px-Dread_Ambusher_Ranged_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Dread_Ambusher_Ranged_Icon.webp/60px-Dread_Ambusher_Ranged_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Dread_Ambusher_Ranged_Icon.webp/80px-Dread_Ambusher_Ranged_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dread Ambusher (Ranged)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Dread_Ambusher_Ranged_Icon.webp/40px-Dread_Ambusher_Ranged_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Dread_Ambusher_Ranged_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dread_Ambusher_(Ranged)\" title=\"Dread Ambusher (Ranged)\">Dread Ambusher (Ranged)</a> </dt>\n<dd>On the first turn of each combat, ambush a target with an additional swift and precise attack. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per combat\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per combat.)</dd>\n</dl></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Dread_Ambusher\">Sources of Dread Ambusher</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dread_Ambusher\" title=\"Dread Ambusher\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Dread_Ambusher_Melee_Icon.webp/30px-Dread_Ambusher_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Dread_Ambusher_Melee_Icon.webp/45px-Dread_Ambusher_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Dread_Ambusher_Melee_Icon.webp/60px-Dread_Ambusher_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dread Ambusher\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Dread_Ambusher_Melee_Icon.webp/30px-Dread_Ambus